    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_interval_map_overlaps" kindref="compound">IntervalMapOverlaps</ref> - Iterate over the overlaps of mapped intervals in two IntervalMaps. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The maps may be different, but the <ref refid="class_key_t" kindref="compound">KeyT</ref> and Traits types should be the same.</para>
<para>Typical uses:</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Test for overlap: bool overlap = IntervalMapOverlaps(a, b).<ref refid="classllvm_1_1_interval_map_overlaps_1ad85fedf8fb1b786bf6ed0d3518790bae" kindref="member">valid()</ref>;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Enumerate overlaps: for (<ref refid="classllvm_1_1_interval_map_overlaps" kindref="compound">IntervalMapOverlaps</ref> <ref refid="_m_d5_8cpp_1ac0eafdc9ee161b71e7af98af736952fd" kindref="member">I(a, b)</ref>; I.valid() ; ++I) { ... } </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
